<title>USA: N.C. $65 mln housing agency bonds verbal award.</title>
<headline>N.C. $65 mln housing agency bonds verbal award.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber Inc. said Tuesday it received the verbal award on North Carolina Housing Finance Agency's $65 million bond deal. No yields were changed from the preliminary pricing.</p>
<p>The pricing follows:</p>
