<p>RE: $65,000,000*</p>
<p>SINGLE FAMILY REVENUE BONDS</p>
<p>(1985 RESOLUTION)</p>
<p>SERIES QQ (NON AMT) AND SERIES RR (AMT)</p>
<p>VERBAL AWARD.</p>
<p>THIS ISSUE WILL BE IN BOOK ENTRY FORM THROUGH THE FACILITIES</p>
<p>OF DTC</p>
